# Force LF in the repo/index regardless of the checkout platform's line
# endings. Without this, a Windows editor touching an existing file (even
# for a tiny content change) can silently flip the whole file to CRLF,
# turning a several-line diff into a several-hundred-line one — on a repo
# with a trust-core CODEOWNERS gate, an unreviewable diff is a safety
# issue, not a formatting preference. See docs/TRACKING.md's PR #109
# incident.
* text=auto eol=lf
